      "id": "b0",
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "Council approves new budget after long debate",
      "dom_anchor": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/article/*[1]",
        "start_offset": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b1",
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The city council voted 7 to 2 on Tuesday to approve next year's budget, which adds funding for parks [3] and road repairs (about $5 million in total).",
      "dom_anchor": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/article/*[2]",
        "start_offset": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Supporters said the plan was overdue. \"It's about time,\" said council member Rosa Diaz, who has pushed for park funding since 2019 (Diaz, 2021).",
      "dom_anchor": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/article/*[3]",
        "start_offset": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b3",
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "What changes",
      "dom_anchor": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/article/*[4]",
        "start_offset": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b4",
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Parks get $2 million for maintenance.",
      "dom_anchor": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/article/*[5]",
        "start_offset": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b5",
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Road repairs get $3 million, see https://example-news.com/budget-table for details.",
      "dom_anchor": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/article/*[6]",
        "start_offset": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b6",
      "type": "blockquote",
      "text": "We will deliver on our promises, the mayor said in a statement.",
      "dom_anchor": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/article/*[7]",
        "start_offset": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b7",
      "type": "figcaption",
      "text": "Figure 2: Council members during the vote on Tuesday.",
      "dom_anchor": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/article/*[8]",
        "start_offset": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b8",
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The budget takes effect in January.",
      "dom_anchor": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/article/*[9]",
        "start_offset": 0
      }
    }
  ]
}
